sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant NextAPI as Next.js API Route
    participant BetterAuth as Better-Auth
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant SPNService as SPN Token Service
    participant Databricks as Databricks API

    Browser->>NextAPI: HTTP Request with Session Cookie

    Note over NextAPI,BetterAuth: Session Validation Phase
    NextAPI->>BetterAuth: Validate Session
    BetterAuth->>Postgres: Query SESSION by token
    Postgres-->>BetterAuth: Session + User + Org data

    alt Session Invalid/Expired
        BetterAuth-->>NextAPI: 401 Unauthorized
        NextAPI-->>Browser: Redirect to Okta Login
    end

    Note over BetterAuth,Okta: User Token Validation
    BetterAuth->>Okta: Validate User Token (if needed)
    Okta-->>BetterAuth: Token Valid

    Note over NextAPI,SPNService: SPN Token Retrieval Phase
    NextAPI->>Postgres: Get Organization SPN Config
    Postgres-->>NextAPI: SPN clientId + encrypted secret
    NextAPI->>SPNService: Get SPN Access Token

    alt SPN Token Missing or Expired
        SPNService->>SPNService: Decrypt client secret
        SPNService->>Databricks: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials
        Databricks-->>SPNService: Access Token (1hr TTL)
        SPNService->>Postgres: Cache encrypted SPN token
    end

    SPNService-->>NextAPI: SPN Bearer Token

    Note over NextAPI,Databricks: Databricks API Call Phase
    NextAPI->>Databricks: API Request with SPN Bearer Token
    Databricks-->>NextAPI: API Response

    Note over NextAPI,Postgres: Optional: Cache/Store Response
    opt Store Response Data
        NextAPI->>Postgres: Cache response
    end

    NextAPI-->>Browser: JSON Response
